WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.933
Turn off the kitchen light.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.033
<v Atlas>Done, I turned off Kitchen Light.

00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:10.833
A voice agent that lives on your hardware.

00:00:11.433 --> 00:00:14.067
My name is Laura, and I can't stand horror films.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.967
<v Marlowe>Laura, horror's not for you, I agree.

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:19.967
A few minutes later

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:22.500
Marlowe, what do you remember about me?

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:28.933
<v Marlowe>Laura, you mentioned you can't stand horror films, and we just talked about it.

00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:32.000
What's the guest wifi password?

00:00:33.167 --> 00:00:35.400
<v Atlas>sunflower twenty twenty six

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:37.667
Good night.

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:43.133
<v Atlas>You want me to run the Good night routine. Do you want me to go ahead with that?

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:44.700
Yes.

00:00:45.967 --> 00:00:50.667
<v Atlas>Lights off, front door locked and the alarm is set for seven. Sleep well.

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:59.467
Everything stayed in the house.
